    <config key="metadata">
        <entry key="description" type="xstring" value="Metanode calculates cumulative statistics individually from the selected columns.%%00010%%00010The provided columns are process individually in the following way:%%000101) each column is sorted from the lowest to the highest values (missing values are kept at the beginning)%%000102) moving aggregation statistics (e.g., sum) is calculated for individual rows of the sorted column (e.g., there is sum of the first ten rows on the 10. row in case of the cumulative sum is calculated)%%000103) column is resorted back to the original order%%000104) common prefix and or suffix is added to the calculated columns%%000105) suffix is added to the calculated columns based on the cumulative statistics calculated%%00010%%00010Statistics possible to calculate are the following:%%00010- sum - returns the cumulative sum from the lowest to the higher values%%00010- count - returns cumulative cound from the lowest to the highest value (i.e., order of values is returned)%%00010%%00010%%00010You can return only the calculated columns or add them to the original data matrix.%%00010%%00010=================%%00010%%00010Used programs and tools and their respective licenses at the time of the metanode creation. Version numbers and the licenses might differ based on your local installation. Please inspect your local installation and contact us if you can not locate your local version and or license terms.%%00010%%00010KNIME nodes (The KNIME nodes consists of the following GNU GPL 3.0 License. Licence terms are available here: https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl.html)%%00010Python 3 (The Python consists of the following Python 3 License. Licence terms are available here: https://docs.python.org/3/license.html)%%00010%%00010The metanode was created in KNIME 4.7.7 running inside the docker image (https://hub.docker.com/r/cfprot/knime/), tag 4.7.7a.%%00010%%00010=================%%00010%%00010This version of metanode is available under the GNU GPL 3.0 License, unless stated otherwise. The full version of the license terms is available at https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl.html.%%00010Version: 0.1.1 from 2025-03-20%%00010Contact person: David Potesil (david.potesil@ceitec.muni.cz)%%00010More information can be found at https://github.com/OmicsWorkflows/KNIME_metanodes."/>
